{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901",
    "name": "Catalog Service",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the Catalog Service.\n\n**Base URL:** `{{baseUrl}}`  (default: `http://localhost:5502`)\n\n**Auth:** Protected endpoints require an `accessToken` httpOnly cookie (set after login via auth-service).\n\n**Roles:**\n- `admin` – full access to create/update\n- `manager` – can create/update products & toppings for their own tenant\n- Public – can read categories, products, and toppings\n\n**Note:** Product and Topping create/update endpoints use `multipart/form-data` because they accept an image file upload (sent to AWS S3).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5502",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "categoryId",
      "value": "65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "MongoDB ObjectId of a category"
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": "65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d2",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "MongoDB ObjectId of a product"
    },
    {
      "key": "tenantId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Tenant (restaurant) ID from auth-service"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Categories",
      "description": "Product category management (e.g., Pizza, Beverages).\n\nGET endpoints are public. POST and PATCH require admin role.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Category",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Pizza\",\n  \"priceConfiguration\": {\n    \"Size\": {\n      \"priceType\": \"base\",\n      \"availableOptions\": [\"Small\", \"Medium\", \"Large\"]\n    },\n    \"Crust\": {\n      \"priceType\": \"aditional\",\n      \"availableOptions\": [\"Thin\", \"Thick\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Wholewheat\",\n      \"widgetType\": \"switch\",\n      \"defaultValue\": \"No\",\n      \"availableOptions\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["categories"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new product category.\n\n**Auth required:** `accessToken` cookie with `admin` role.\n\n**Returns:** `{ id: string }` (MongoDB ObjectId)\n\n**Validation rules:**\n- `name` – required string\n- `priceConfiguration` – required object; each key's `priceType` must be `base` or `aditional`\n- `attributes` – required array"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 Created",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Pizza\",\n  \"priceConfiguration\": {\n    \"Size\": { \"priceType\": \"base\", \"availableOptions\": [\"Small\", \"Medium\", \"Large\"] }\n  },\n  \"attributes\": []\n}" },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories" }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Categories",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["categories"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve all product categories.\n\n**Auth required:** None (public).\n\n**Returns:** Array of Category objects."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories" } },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "[\n  {\n    \"_id\": \"65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1\",\n    \"name\": \"Pizza\",\n    \"priceConfiguration\": {\n      \"Size\": { \"priceType\": \"base\", \"availableOptions\": [\"Small\", \"Medium\", \"Large\"] },\n      \"Crust\": { \"priceType\": \"aditional\", \"availableOptions\": [\"Thin\", \"Thick\"] }\n    },\n    \"attributes\": [\n      { \"name\": \"Wholewheat\", \"widgetType\": \"switch\", \"defaultValue\": \"No\", \"availableOptions\": [] }\n    ],\n    \"createdAt\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\"\n  }\n]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Category By ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["categories", "{{categoryId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve a single category by its MongoDB ObjectId.\n\n**Auth required:** None (public).\n\n**Returns:** Category object."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}" } },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"_id\": \"65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1\",\n  \"name\": \"Pizza\",\n  \"priceConfiguration\": {},\n  \"attributes\": []\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 Not Found",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/invalid-id" } },
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"errors\": [{ \"type\": \"HttpError\", \"message\": \"Category not found\" }]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Category",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Pizza (Updated)\",\n  \"priceConfiguration\": {\n    \"Size\": {\n      \"priceType\": \"base\",\n      \"availableOptions\": [\"Small\", \"Medium\", \"Large\", \"XL\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Wholewheat\",\n      \"widgetType\": \"switch\",\n      \"defaultValue\": \"No\",\n      \"availableOptions\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["categories", "{{categoryId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Update an existing category. Price configurations are deep-merged with existing data.\n\n**Auth required:** `accessToken` cookie with `admin` role.\n\n**Returns:** `{ id: string }`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}" }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Products",
      "description": "Product management for a restaurant tenant.\n\n**Note:** Create and Update use `multipart/form-data` with an `image` file field (max 500 KB). Other fields are sent as form fields.\n\n`priceConfiguration` and `attributes` must be JSON strings (serialised with `JSON.stringify`) when sent as form fields.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "name", "value": "Margherita Pizza", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description", "value": "Classic tomato and mozzarella pizza", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "tenantId", "value": "{{tenantId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "categoryId", "value": "{{categoryId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "isPublish", "value": "true", "type": "text" },
                {
                  "key": "priceConfiguration",
                  "value": "{\"Size\":{\"priceType\":\"base\",\"availableOptions\":{\"Small\":149,\"Medium\":199,\"Large\":249}}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "JSON string of price configuration"
                },
                {
                  "key": "attributes",
                  "value": "[{\"name\":\"Wholewheat\",\"value\":\"No\"}]",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "JSON string of attributes array"
                },
                {
                  "key": "image",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Product image file (max 500 KB)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new product with an image.\n\n**Auth required:** `accessToken` cookie with `admin` or `manager` role.\n\n**Body type:** `multipart/form-data`\n\n**Fields:**\n- `name` – required\n- `description` – required\n- `tenantId` – restaurant ID\n- `categoryId` – MongoDB ObjectId\n- `isPublish` – `true` or `false`\n- `priceConfiguration` – JSON string\n- `attributes` – JSON string (array)\n- `image` – file (max 500 KB)\n\n**Returns:** `{ id: string }`\n\n**Side effect:** Publishes a `PRODUCT_CREATE` event to the `product` Kafka topic."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "POST", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products" } },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d2\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 File Too Large",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "POST", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products" } },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"errors\": [{ \"type\": \"HttpError\", \"message\": \"File size exceeds the limit\" }]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?tenantId={{tenantId}}&categoryId=&isPublish=true&q=&page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "tenantId", "value": "{{tenantId}}", "description": "Filter by restaurant ID" },
                { "key": "categoryId", "value": "", "description": "Filter by category MongoDB ObjectId (optional)" },
                { "key": "isPublish", "value": "true", "description": "Filter by published status: true or false (optional)" },
                { "key": "q", "value": "", "description": "Search query by product name (optional)" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1", "description": "Page number (default: 1)" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10", "description": "Items per page (default: 10)" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve a paginated list of products with optional filters.\n\n**Auth required:** None (public).\n\n**Returns:** `{ data, total, pageSize, currentPage }` – image field contains the full S3 URL."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?tenantId=1&isPublish=true" } },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"_id\": \"65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d2\",\n      \"name\": \"Margherita Pizza\",\n      \"description\": \"Classic tomato and mozzarella pizza\",\n      \"image\": \"https://catalog-service-dev.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/some-uuid\",\n      \"tenantId\": \"1\",\n      \"categoryId\": \"65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1\",\n      \"isPublish\": true,\n      \"priceConfiguration\": {},\n      \"attributes\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total\": 1,\n  \"pageSize\": 10,\n  \"currentPage\": 1\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "name", "value": "Margherita Pizza (Updated)", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description", "value": "Updated classic pizza", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "tenantId", "value": "{{tenantId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "categoryId", "value": "{{categoryId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "isPublish", "value": "true", "type": "text" },
                {
                  "key": "priceConfiguration",
                  "value": "{\"Size\":{\"priceType\":\"base\",\"availableOptions\":{\"Small\":159,\"Medium\":209,\"Large\":269}}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "attributes",
                  "value": "[{\"name\":\"Wholewheat\",\"value\":\"Yes\"}]",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "image",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "New product image (optional — omit to keep existing image)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{productId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Update an existing product. Image is optional — if not provided, the existing image is kept.\n\n**Auth required:** `accessToken` cookie with `admin` or `manager` role. Managers can only update their own tenant's products.\n\n**Body type:** `multipart/form-data`\n\n**Returns:** `{ id: string }`\n\n**Side effect:** Publishes a `PRODUCT_UPDATE` event to the `product` Kafka topic."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "PUT", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}" } },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d2\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "403 Forbidden (Wrong Tenant)",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "PUT", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}" } },
              "status": "Forbidden",
              "code": 403,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"errors\": [{ \"type\": \"HttpError\", \"message\": \"You are not allowed to access this product\" }]\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Toppings",
      "description": "Pizza topping management.\n\nCreate requires `admin` or `manager` role. GET is public.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Topping",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "name", "value": "Extra Cheese", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "price", "value": "49", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "tenantId", "value": "{{tenantId}}", "type": "text" },
                {
                  "key": "image",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Topping image file (max 500 KB)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/toppings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["toppings"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new topping with an image.\n\n**Auth required:** `accessToken` cookie with `admin` or `manager` role.\n\n**Body type:** `multipart/form-data`\n\n**Fields:**\n- `name` – required string\n- `price` – required number\n- `tenantId` – required restaurant ID\n- `image` – required file (max 500 KB)\n\n**Returns:** `{ id: string }`\n\n**Side effect:** Publishes a `TOPPING_CREATE` event to the `topping` Kafka topic."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "POST", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/toppings" } },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d3\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Toppings",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/toppings?tenantId={{tenantId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["toppings"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "tenantId", "value": "{{tenantId}}", "description": "Filter toppings by restaurant/tenant ID" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve all toppings for a given tenant.\n\n**Auth required:** None (public).\n\n**Returns:** Array of Topping objects with full S3 image URLs."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/toppings?tenantId=1" } },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d3\",\n    \"name\": \"Extra Cheese\",\n    \"price\": 49,\n    \"tenantId\": \"1\",\n    \"image\": \"https://catalog-service-dev.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/some-uuid\"\n  }\n]"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
